# Timestamped DB/state backups (live_trades.db.bak-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS,
# control.json.bak-...). The bare *.bak rule above does NOT catch these -
# they end in .bak-<timestamp> - and they hold REAL trade history.
*.bak-*
# Generated research/report artifacts. The one-off .py scripts that produce
# these are deliberately left untracked rather than ignored, so they stay
# visible in git status until someone decides a given one is worth keeping.
